<title>USA: ANB elects chairman.</title>
<headline>ANB elects chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MUNCIE, Ind. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANB Corp said Tuesday that Kelly Stanley, president and chief executive officer of Ontario Corp, was elected chairman of the board.</p>
<p>ANB provides commercial banking, trust and asset management products and services.</p>
<p>Stanley succeeds William Peterson, who will continue as a director of the company.  </p>
<p>ANB added that James Schrecongost was elected vice chairman of the company. He is also president and chief executive officer of the firm.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
